1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,700
From now on, mom and dad

2
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:01,433
will be in your care

3
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:02,533
What

4
00:00:02,733 --> 00:00:03,400
You mean

5
00:00:03,433 --> 00:00:04,566
you're dumping them on us

6
00:00:04,566 --> 00:00:05,433
and washing your hands of them

7
00:00:05,566 --> 00:00:06,833
Don't put it that way

8
00:00:06,966 --> 00:00:08,000
It's not that I don't care

9
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
I just have no money

10
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,800
How about you pay off my loan shark debt

11
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:11,700
and buy back my house

12
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:12,433
Then without a word

13
00:00:12,533 --> 00:00:13,333
I'll take them and leave

14
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:14,333
and never bother you again

15
00:00:14,566 --> 00:00:15,066
How about that

16
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:16,766
If you're trying to use this

17
00:00:16,766 --> 00:00:17,633
to force me to pay your debts

18
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:19,233
then you're dead wrong

19
00:00:19,266 --> 00:00:20,100
If you don't pay

20
00:00:20,233 --> 00:00:21,700
mom and dad will live with you

21
00:00:21,866 --> 00:00:22,933
You can't just watch them

22
00:00:22,933 --> 00:00:23,866
starve to death with me

23
00:00:25,566 --> 00:00:26,200
Lewes

24
00:00:26,433 --> 00:00:26,966
Cynthia

25
00:00:27,166 --> 00:00:28,633
We can't count on Daniel

26
00:00:28,766 --> 00:00:29,633
I don't ask for much

27
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:31,733
just some food for your dad and me

28
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:32,966
and a place to stay

29
00:00:33,066 --> 00:00:33,600
Lewes

30
00:00:33,866 --> 00:00:34,866
We won't eat for free

31
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,500
Your mom and I can still work

32
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,033
Feed the forest frogs

33
00:00:37,066 --> 00:00:38,366
We can clean up too

34
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,766
Please don't kick us out

35
00:00:39,933 --> 00:00:41,400
They're his in-laws after all

36
00:00:41,533 --> 00:00:42,433
He can't just ignore them

37
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,166
Daniel is a bit unreliable

38
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,900
but he can't watch the elders starve

39
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:47,400
Lewes is rich now

40
00:00:47,566 --> 00:00:48,966
Supporting two elders is no big deal

41
00:00:49,733 --> 00:00:50,333
Lewes

42
00:00:52,766 --> 00:00:53,566
Mom, Dad

43
00:00:53,700 --> 00:00:55,100
What are you saying

44
00:00:55,266 --> 00:00:56,966
We won't make you work

45
00:00:57,266 --> 00:00:58,766
A son-in-law is half a son

46
00:00:58,866 --> 00:01:00,300
It's my duty to support you

47
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:01,100
It worked

48
00:01:01,233 --> 00:01:02,533
As long as they stay at the farm

49
00:01:02,533 --> 00:01:03,566
they can definitely steal the formula

50
00:01:03,966 --> 00:01:05,500
I knew Lewes was a dutiful son

51
00:01:05,533 --> 00:01:06,400
He wouldn't abandon us

52
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:08,733
Cynthia

53
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:09,766
Go ask the village chief

54
00:01:09,766 --> 00:01:10,666
who has a house for rent

55
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:11,966
Rent a house for them

56
00:01:12,033 --> 00:01:12,966
and buy some meat and veggies

57
00:01:13,133 --> 00:01:14,266
Let them stay peacefully in the village

58
00:01:14,566 --> 00:01:15,366
I'll cover their living expenses

59
00:01:15,666 --> 00:01:16,733
Back to the village

60
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:17,600
No way
